{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0654_1000_p", "source_sha256": "90147276060dcb0b3e285a94f6adfa480d288c7becbd77e89c93fbc2561bfc6f", "ja": "（今日は入浴剤のCM撮影。バラが咲き誇る庭園での\n撮影だったが、静香はずっと、気分が乗っていたな）", "zh": "（今天是拍摄入浴剂广告。虽然是在玫瑰盛开的庭园里拍摄，但静香一直都很有兴致啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0654_1001_p", "source_sha256": "77e09102e0dbc3ea540530b304acdb9bb6d85a691ce85cd49fd27cbbaf463828", "ja": "よし、これで最後のカットも終了だな！\nお疲れ様、静香。いい感じだったと思うよ。", "zh": "好，这样最后一个镜头也拍完了！\n辛苦了，静香。我觉得效果很不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0654_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "0f2f0168edb40d638b28ce91ff5161eda5b8bab29c92f2b4fd19ef2a0390aa33", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\n私もとても楽しい一日でした。", "zh": "非常感谢您！\n对我来说，这也是非常开心的一天。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0654_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "3e16159e8ee75322edf875a47d65e92968e1d39722b405e63154985a0135f32d", "ja": "綺麗なバラが、一面に咲いていて。\nなんだか、夢の中にいるみたいで……。", "zh": "漂亮的玫瑰花开满了整片大地。总觉得就像身处梦中一样……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0654_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2e63c3e06b69f6089f14b61977e3513b784a7326d638b56cc8dea647b4906192", "ja": "そうだな、絢爛で華やかで……。幻想的だったな。\nだけど静香も負けてなかったぞ！", "zh": "是啊，绚丽又华美……简直如梦似幻。不过，静香也一点都不逊色哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0654_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "64f8b347513bd5cae8f92109eaf32c107a074a0f85bd9fcaae086e06b5959506", "ja": "本当ですか……！　今回は衣装もロケーションも\n素敵なので、大人っぽく見えるよう意識してたんです。", "zh": "真的吗……！这次的服装和取景都很棒，所以我一直注意着要让自己看起来更成熟一些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0654_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "c2b9bc09be96d0fb47d6d40335736bacff0933daae40e52dcfdfe4a9dfbb3aa4", "ja": "今の私より、ずっと年上に見えたらいいなって。\nちゃんとできてたなら、安心しました。", "zh": "要是能看起来比现在的我成熟很多就好了。\n如果确实做到了，那我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0654_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3af397cb2cabcf93ee3e5f0deeab83de9f843886193daada843f45cbdcfe3be2", "ja": "ああ、バッチリだったよ！　ファンの人たちも\nきっと、ビックリするんじゃないかな。", "zh": "啊，做得非常好！粉丝们肯定也会大吃一惊吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0654_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ab8f26dc767791ce573bf3582811b078f5e5f66050fe3a97df77fe2ef86d376b", "ja": "あ、そうだ……。静香に、これを渡そうと思って。", "zh": "啊，对了……我想把这个交给静香。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0654_1009", "source_sha256": "b05032f2134c7e9bb5848576cb143e26657ac0276b402557840383e23a5b6741", "ja": "プレゼントを渡す", "zh": "赠送礼物", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0654_2000_015siz", "source_sha256": "78888738625e32cfe60806c07a8f3375faa1920836fd5d6f2f6f226e02952994", "ja": "えっ？　なんですか、これ。\nバラの花ですけど……まさか、石鹸？", "zh": "诶？这是什么？\n虽然是玫瑰花……难道是肥皂？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0654_2001_p", "source_sha256": "b9976b124750d4c4db960afb07ce64998dcff93953ccd2ffa86854e5bc0eb1c7", "ja": "ああ。入浴剤と一緒に使えると思ってね。\n今回は、たくさん頑張ってくれたから。", "zh": "啊。我想应该可以和入浴剂一起用。\n这次你努力了这么久，就当作奖励。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0654_2002_015siz", "source_sha256": "8932b5055f8b630459019823d0603c0eb69132df7607861271c86ccc099e31e8", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます……。\n{$P$}も、たまには気が利く……。", "zh": "啊，谢谢您……。\n{$P$}偶尔也挺会体贴人的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0654_2003_015siz", "source_sha256": "1edef90828d98e0d31e75f7eada66b10865cf8195a4415409752b481408154da", "ja": "ま、まさか、変な意味はないですよね！？", "zh": "不、不会是有什么奇怪的意思吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0654_2004_p", "source_sha256": "ea6f1bbd5a6a6e10f8cbaf0c4aacb467c1217faa93192ce192e05b1d3d7042e6", "ja": "ええっ！？　ないない！\nただ、静香をねぎらおうと思ってだな……。", "zh": "诶！？没有没有！\n只是想慰劳一下静香……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0654_2005_015siz", "source_sha256": "fadfe32aa2beba50dc4306ca9720b41772dab3a5aefc2b7717d1960382374db7", "ja": "ふふっ、冗談です。でも、びっくりしました。\nこんな大人っぽいものをくれるなんて。", "zh": "呵呵，只是开个玩笑。不过，真是吓了我一跳。\n没想到你会送我这么成熟的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0654_2006_p", "source_sha256": "e489c3c55b2de57d973f7c586b3987b9a32fb66b3eff37ad02e70561110c0d6e", "ja": "うっ……。静香に似合うと思ったんだけど。\nちょっとキザだったかな？", "zh": "唔……我觉得挺适合静香的啊。\n是不是显得有点耍帅了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0654_2007_015siz", "source_sha256": "21044a3fb5679d46b14b68ab68644d1a076d69060af73862e6235f557dc7855c", "ja": "そうですね。このお仕事じゃなかったら、\n怪しいと思って、疑ってたかもしれません。", "zh": "是啊。要不是这份工作，\n我可能会觉得可疑，对你产生怀疑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0654_2008_015siz", "source_sha256": "f6ff5c57d9a7f5f52d763ede7d7fa1a4ece58da566d4b1570b0d59f7495d19b5", "ja": "でも、今日の雰囲気にピッタリだったから。\n……許してあげます。ふふっ♪", "zh": "不过，因为和今天的气氛非常相称。\n……我就原谅你吧。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0654_2009_015siz", "source_sha256": "5323c5fec6eb4d53481979dced620bbe63470b06c010ff68666769dab8de2353", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}。\n大切に、部屋に飾りますね。", "zh": "谢谢您，{$P$}。\n我会好好珍藏，装饰在房间里的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
